{
  "duration": 75.799,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 0.28,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.62,
      "end": 1.339,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.959,
      "end": 3.579,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.219,
      "end": 5.96,
      "text": "Now in this problem, a postman traveled"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.42,
      "end": 9.139,
      "text": "total sixty-five kilometer in eight hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.699,
      "end": 10.939,
      "text": "He did some part by walking"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.38,
      "end": 12.759,
      "text": "and some part by cycling."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.359,
      "end": 15.359,
      "text": "Walking speed is five kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.979,
      "end": 16.859,
      "text": "Cycling speed is"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.279,
      "end": 18.639,
      "text": "ten kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.199,
      "end": 20.579,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 22.199,
      "text": "the cycling distance."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.859,
      "end": 25.0,
      "text": "Let us take walking distance as X kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.579,
      "end": 29.519,
      "text": "So cycling distance will be sixty-five minus X kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.039,
      "end": 31.439,
      "text": "Now, we know one basic formula,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.899,
      "end": 34.259,
      "text": "time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.619,
      "end": 37.199,
      "text": "So time taken while walking will be X divided by five,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.659,
      "end": 41.919,
      "text": "and time taken while cycling will be sixty-five minus X divided by ten."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.5,
      "end": 48.919,
      "text": "Total time is given as eight hours, so we can write X by five plus sixty-five minus X by ten is equal to eight."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.34,
      "end": 50.779,
      "text": "Now, take LCM as ten."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.299,
      "end": 57.139,
      "text": "So this becomes two x plus sixty-five minus X divided by ten is equal to eight."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.759,
      "end": 62.219,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get X plus sixty-five is equal to eighty."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.759,
      "end": 64.22,
      "text": "So X is equal to fifteen."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.639,
      "end": 67.139,
      "text": "That means walking distance is fifteen kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.619,
      "end": 70.019,
      "text": "So cycling distance is sixty-five minus fifteen,"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.4,
      "end": 71.699,
      "text": "which is fifty kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.18,
      "end": 74.5,
      "text": "Hence, the final answer will be option A,"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 75.799,
      "text": "fifty kilometer."
    }
  ],
